        ("Sassy social media voice", "The 2017 nuggets tweet became the most-retweeted ever (profits up about 50%); the “We Beefin?” mixtape hit #1 on Spotify’s Global Viral 50; now an album, “Songs To Listen To In A Wendy’s Parking Lot.”", false),
        ("Pop culture collabs", "Viral limited drops: Netflix’s Wednesday “Meal of Misfortune” (Aug 2025), the SpongeBob Krabby Patty Kollab (Oct 2025) and Lisa Barlow’s “Baby Gorgeous Meal.”", false),
        ("Kids’ Rewards club", "A free Jr. Frosty for every straight-A report card, a free kids’ meal on their birthday, and toy codes that unlock a digital collection in the app.", true),
